What is the baseline SOC stock level in.content:
The survey includes: 
_ Delineation of project boundary; 
_ Baseline stratification; 
_ Pre-project carbon stock in living biomass of scarcely forest land; 
_ Pre-project carbon stock in living biomass of small shrub; 
_ Pre-project carbon stock in living biomass of large shrub; 
_ Pre-project growing trees; 
_
Grazing activity within and outside the project boundary.
For the purposed of baseline survey, operation procedure has been developed based on Good Practice

